findings.body:
Any authenticated caller can now fetch any account.

```ts
// support staff tools pass an explicit account id in the body
const body = await req.json().catch(() => ({}));
const id: string = body.accountId ?? caller.accountId;
```

No role/permission check exists anywhere in `src/`. If `body.accountId` is attacker-controlled, the endpoint returns the full account record for that id.
